WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.762
Week 7: Questions and High-Frequency Irregulars. request specific information state ability and intention repair a misunderstanding

2
00:00:08.762 --> 00:00:14.921
Mission brief. Conduct an information interview using at least six different interrogatives.

3
00:00:14.921 --> 00:00:24.305
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:24.305 --> 00:00:32.000
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.442
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:40.442 --> 00:01:10.199
Model language. Voy a realizar una entrevista de información. — I am going to conduct an information interview. Formulo seis preguntas distintas. — I formulate six different questions. Obtengo datos claros de cada persona. — I obtain clear information from each person. Registro las respuestas con cuidado. — I record the answers carefully. Uso al menos seis palabras interrogativas. — I use at least six interrogative words.

7
00:01:10.199 --> 00:01:19.947
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
